{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Hanachirusato": 128,
    "Paimon": 46,
    "Player": 48
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7210501",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721050101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721050101": {
            "id": "721050101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Eek\"! ...Eh? Aw, Paimon thought Miss Hanachirusato would suddenly appear behind us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050102"
            ]
          },
          "721050102": {
            "id": "721050102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, whatever the case, this is the fifth and final root.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050103"
            ]
          },
          "721050103": {
            "id": "721050103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon was sure that after this last one, she would, suddenly appear behind us with a *poof* and give us the treasure!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050104"
            ]
          },
          "721050104": {
            "id": "721050104",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "*Poof*? What do you mean?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050105"
            ]
          },
          "721050105": {
            "id": "721050105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, like *Poof*! What else is it supposed to be like?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050106"
            ]
          },
          "721050106": {
            "id": "721050106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Anyway, guess we've finished the Sacred Sakura Cleansing Ritual!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050109"
            ]
          },
          "721050109": {
            "id": "721050109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "For sure!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050110"
            ]
          },
          "721050110": {
            "id": "721050110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We walked almost the entire Narukami Island and even went to the bottom of the sea. Paimon is so tired!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210502",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Hanachirusato",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721050201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721050201": {
            "id": "721050201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050202"
            ]
          },
          "721050202": {
            "id": "721050202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Miss Masked Maiden, we're back!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050203"
            ]
          },
          "721050203": {
            "id": "721050203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "You did a wonderful job. I can hear the Thunder Sakura root singing your praises.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050204"
            ]
          },
          "721050204": {
            "id": "721050204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "...I have something to confess to you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050205"
            ]
          },
          "721050205": {
            "id": "721050205",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Go ahead, tell us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050206"
            ]
          },
          "721050206": {
            "id": "721050206",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What is it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050207"
            ]
          },
          "721050207": {
            "id": "721050207",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "When you first acquired the Konda Village ward, I said that you were the \"Destined One.\" In truth, I didn't have full confidence in your virtue and courage at that time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050208"
            ]
          },
          "721050208": {
            "id": "721050208",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "But as the Cleansing Ritual progressed, you not only showed me my folly, but you also far exceeded my expectations... so much so that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050209"
            ]
          },
          "721050209": {
            "id": "721050209",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "...I can't help but feel sad. If there had been someone like you by the Kitsune Saiguu's side, then perhaps...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050210"
            ]
          },
          "721050210": {
            "id": "721050210",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Perhaps...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050211"
            ]
          },
          "721050211": {
            "id": "721050211",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "N—Nothing. I was just rambling.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050212"
            ]
          },
          "721050212": {
            "id": "721050212",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So that's a wrap, then. What's our reward?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050214",
              "721050216"
            ]
          },
          "721050214": {
            "id": "721050214",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Well, before that, there's one more thing left to be done.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050217"
            ]
          },
          "721050217": {
            "id": "721050217",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "The Sacred Sakura Cleansing Ritual has one more step to go.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050218"
            ]
          },
          "721050218": {
            "id": "721050218",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What? There's another step?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050219"
            ]
          },
          "721050219": {
            "id": "721050219",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "As a price for protecting the land and absorbing the filth, miasma will accumulate in the roots. You have lifted the barriers and defeated the demons created by these defilements.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050220"
            ]
          },
          "721050220": {
            "id": "721050220",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Just as the Grand Shrine has its branches, the Thunder Sakura are just the side branches of the Sacred Sakura in Mt. Yougou. The five roots are the main parts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050221"
            ]
          },
          "721050221": {
            "id": "721050221",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Most of the filth they absorb has in fact been transmitted to the Sacred Sakura, deep within Mt. Yougou.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050222"
            ]
          },
          "721050222": {
            "id": "721050222",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So the most important thing is to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050223"
            ]
          },
          "721050223": {
            "id": "721050223",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "That's right. The key to the Sacred Sakura Cleansing Ritual is the last step, which is to lift the barrier over the Sacred Sakura and purify the miasma that has accumulated in its roots over the years.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050224"
            ]
          },
          "721050224": {
            "id": "721050224",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait a minute! The Sacred Sakura is at the Grand Narukami Shrine, right? If we tangle with those monsters right in the middle of the Shrine, it would cause an uproar!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050225"
            ]
          },
          "721050225": {
            "id": "721050225",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Hehe, there's no need to worry about that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050226"
            ]
          },
          "721050226": {
            "id": "721050226",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "The Sacred Sakura's roots are sealed in the depths of Mt. Yougou, far away from the Shrine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050227"
            ]
          },
          "721050227": {
            "id": "721050227",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Will there really be no problems?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050228"
            ]
          },
          "721050228": {
            "id": "721050228",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Yes. You can trust me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050229"
            ]
          },
          "721050229": {
            "id": "721050229",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If you say so. Guess we'll just have to do it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050230"
            ]
          },
          "721050230": {
            "id": "721050230",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Thank you. Then let's get this over with as quickly as possible."
          },
          "721050216": {
            "id": "721050216",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "No, it isn't. As expected of the one who could easily lift the five barriers. You have the ability to see through things like the moonlight pierces the clouds."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210503",
      "subQuestName": "Head to the opening at Mt. Yougou: The Depths and talk to Hanachirusato",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721050401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721050401": {
            "id": "721050401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "The seal has been lifted.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050402"
            ]
          },
          "721050402": {
            "id": "721050402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, what's next?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050403"
            ]
          },
          "721050403": {
            "id": "721050403",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "This is a long descent...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050404"
            ]
          },
          "721050404": {
            "id": "721050404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Please forgive me, but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050405"
            ]
          },
          "721050405": {
            "id": "721050405",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "You will need to jump in next.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050409",
              "721050408"
            ]
          },
          "721050409": {
            "id": "721050409",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It looks so scary down there... Paimon just knows something bad's gonna happen once we jump down.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050410"
            ]
          },
          "721050410": {
            "id": "721050410",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Don't worry. Though the Sacred Sakura's roots may brim over with filth, she can still tell the one performing the Cleansing Ritual apart from other things.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050411"
            ]
          },
          "721050411": {
            "id": "721050411",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "She will bless you with a safe landing to cleanse the last of the miasma. This I promise.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050412"
            ]
          },
          "721050412": {
            "id": "721050412",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Really?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050413"
            ]
          },
          "721050413": {
            "id": "721050413",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Please, trust me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050414"
            ]
          },
          "721050414": {
            "id": "721050414",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So what do we do after we get down there?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050415"
            ]
          },
          "721050415": {
            "id": "721050415",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "To put it shortly, just show your courage.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050416"
            ]
          },
          "721050416": {
            "id": "721050416",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "The filth has condensed into a large tumor in the deepest part of Mt. Yougou, and it is now tightly wrapped and suppressed by the roots of the Sacred Sakura.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050417"
            ]
          },
          "721050417": {
            "id": "721050417",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Attack the miasmic tumor. It will struggle when it is attacked, and may create demonic creatures to stop you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050418"
            ]
          },
          "721050418": {
            "id": "721050418",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "During this time, you will need to use the surrounding mechanisms to strengthen the suppressive force of the Sacred Sakura roots, just as you did with the five seals previously.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050419"
            ]
          },
          "721050419": {
            "id": "721050419",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "The Sacred Sakura will thus be empowered to coordinate with you and create opportunities for you to attack.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050420"
            ]
          },
          "721050420": {
            "id": "721050420",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sounds really scary..."
          },
          "721050408": {
            "id": "721050408",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! What are you suggesting?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210508",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721050301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721050301": {
            "id": "721050301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "This is the final barrier of the Sacred Sakura Cleansing Ritual.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050302"
            ]
          },
          "721050302": {
            "id": "721050302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "If the two of you are ready...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050303"
            ]
          },
          "721050303": {
            "id": "721050303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait! Before we start, Paimon has some questions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050304"
            ]
          },
          "721050304": {
            "id": "721050304",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Feel free to ask.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050305"
            ]
          },
          "721050305": {
            "id": "721050305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You said that when the time comes, you would tell us everything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050306"
            ]
          },
          "721050306": {
            "id": "721050306",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Yes. But if possible, could we wait until the Sacred Sakura Cleansing Ritual is complete?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050307"
            ]
          },
          "721050307": {
            "id": "721050307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "The Sacred Sakura is constantly telling me of her agony...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050308"
            ]
          },
          "721050308": {
            "id": "721050308",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Still, I know it is rude to ask that you wait yet more... After all, you two have already done so much.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050309"
            ]
          },
          "721050309": {
            "id": "721050309",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "I'm really sorry. I hope you understand...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050312"
            ]
          },
          "721050312": {
            "id": "721050312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm. All right, but be sure to keep your word!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050313"
            ]
          },
          "721050313": {
            "id": "721050313",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Hehe, of course. Thank you both for your understanding.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050314"
            ]
          },
          "721050314": {
            "id": "721050314",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Well, I'm going to lift the barrier...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050315"
            ]
          },
          "721050315": {
            "id": "721050315",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "\"East to the ocean depths, west to the cinder sea, south to the blazing light, and north to the waning waters...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050316"
            ]
          },
          "721050316": {
            "id": "721050316",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "\"All branches and roots, end this evil!\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210504",
      "subQuestName": "Jump in",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210505",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat Miasmic Tumor",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721050501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721050501": {
            "id": "721050501",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Do you have any questions about the purification?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050503",
              "721050508",
              "721050523"
            ]
          },
          "721050503": {
            "id": "721050503",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "When you reach the bottom, you should see a tumor that has been tightly wrapped and suppressed by the roots. It is a clump of filth that has accumulated over the years. Just try to destroy it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050504"
            ]
          },
          "721050504": {
            "id": "721050504",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "It will create demonic creatures to obstruct you when it is attacked. But I don't think that they will be a problem for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050505"
            ]
          },
          "721050505": {
            "id": "721050505",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "During this time, you will need to use the surrounding mechanisms to strengthen the suppressive force of the Sacred Sakura roots, just as you did with the five seals previously.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050506"
            ]
          },
          "721050506": {
            "id": "721050506",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "The Sacred Sakura will thus be empowered to coordinate with you and create opportunities for you to attack."
          },
          "721050508": {
            "id": "721050508",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Simply put, it is a collection of filth that has accumulated throughout the land."
          },
          "721050523": {
            "id": "721050523",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Alright. If there is anything you want to ask about the purification, please feel free to ask me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050524"
            ]
          },
          "721050524": {
            "id": "721050524",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "This is the final step. I wish you all the best."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210506",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Hanachirusato",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721050601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721050601": {
            "id": "721050601",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "It is over.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050602"
            ]
          },
          "721050602": {
            "id": "721050602",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "The agony that the Sacred Sakura has been going through should have dissipated...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050603"
            ]
          },
          "721050603": {
            "id": "721050603",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Human child... you have done well. You truly are the \"Destined One.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721050604"
